Now create 4 storages on shopkeep, all with role-gated CRUD auth:
- Product: { id, sku (unique), name, description, price (NUMBER, required), cost (NUMBER), stock (INTEGER, default 0), createdAt }
- Customer: { id, name (required), phone, email, createdAt }
- Sale: { id, customerId (relates Customer), total (NUMBER), tax (NUMBER), createdAt, cashierId (USER) }
- SaleLine: { id, saleId (relates Sale), productId (relates Product), quantity (INTEGER, required), unitPrice (NUMBER), lineTotal (NUMBER) }
Use sensible defaults: admin all-access; cashier+manager read on Product/Customer, write on Sale/SaleLine.

